abstract: >
  A visual courier benchmark and RL environment over rendered cities:
  multi-turn vision-language navigation, pickups and deliveries against a
  clock, with pedestrian signals, road obstacles, per-city photograph albums,
  a measurement-verified signal legibility gate, and a live-engine any-point
  (pixel-goal) navigation track. Includes GRPO training infrastructure and
  reward, curriculum and scaling experiment suites.
